Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 22:14:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ac: GetAPSSIDList returns an empty list (Build 138)

The StreetPass module (cecd) calls ac:u GetAPSSIDList (0x003C0042, a
0xE14-byte mapped output buffer) each time NDM resumes StreetPass after
a game (Nintendogs + Cats, 2026-10-30), and got "unimplemented". The
list holds access points the console should know about (most likely
StreetPass relay points); the emulated console has none saved, so the
buffer is zeroed (count 0) and success is returned. Logged once at Info,
then at Debug. Also on ac:i.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FYz3krf43qKGY6aS2Z5snz
